{"name": "SACRATA", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/d8e25a65d31d4b5e9fa8e3c77451e810.poster.avif?t=1790303299\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/d8e25a65d31d4b5e9fa8e3c77451e810.webm?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/d8e25a65d31d4b5e9fa8e3c77451e810.mp4?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SACRATA</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite that blends Diablo-inspired loot with intense horde-survival combat. Randomized skills and equipment make every run a new opportunity to forge powerful gear, craft specialized builds, and unleash devastating combinations. Hunt for loot, discover Relics, and grow stronger with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hunt for Loot in a Dark Fantasy Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slaying enemies is just the beginning\u2014the promise of better gear keeps you coming back. Defeat the Darkfallen and claim their loot. Every drop could bring a powerful upgrade, unlock new build possibilities, or reveal a legendary piece of gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/b48e164541a7a93bb23a252aca0c2020.poster.avif?t=1790303299\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/b48e164541a7a93bb23a252aca0c2020.webm?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/b48e164541a7a93bb23a252aca0c2020.mp4?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beauty That Slays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your goddess from a cast of captivating characters, then shape her build with your choice of gear and skills. Unleash her true power against the darkness, and become the deadliest presence amid the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/633004dd90cabc185d98f5a33e4009aa.poster.avif?t=1790303299\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/633004dd90cabc185d98f5a33e4009aa.webm?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/633004dd90cabc185d98f5a33e4009aa.mp4?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest talent points, upgrade and temper your gear, and choose affixes that enhance your key stats to craft a build of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/50fe865b14f28d6f5bec7486cb248ec9.poster.avif?t=1790303299\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/50fe865b14f28d6f5bec7486cb248ec9.webm?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/50fe865b14f28d6f5bec7486cb248ec9.mp4?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful bosses put you to the test. Read their attacks, reposition, and seize openings to strike. Balance damage with survival as you push your build and survival skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3a3f46dd8279b694deffc0c330e43fc3.poster.avif?t=1790303299\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3a3f46dd8279b694deffc0c330e43fc3.webm?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3a3f46dd8279b694deffc0c330e43fc3.mp4?t=1790303299\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More content awaits your discovery\u2014stay tuned!</h2> </div>", "short_desc": "SACRATA is a Diablo-like roguelite looter with horde-survival combat. Fight through relentless hordes, create skill builds, unlock a roster of heroes, challenge formidable bosses, and claim ancient Relics. Experience the thrill of intense combat and ultimate destruction!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/4a2b7c1298528f8998faa92f6d198bfd70685a0f/header.jpg?t=1790303299", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "3D", "Loot", "RPG", "Action", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "SuperLimber Studio", "publishers": "SuperLimber Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3201450", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/g7CXWVjaXO4", "first_seen": 1790287200.0, "review_rank": 2}